We formed our sample of the Dark Bay to avoid the high velocity features ('E' and 'I' ) found in \citet{vdw13}. Figure~\ref{fig:Northernsamples} shows its location, that is 45\arcsec\ square and is centered 113\farcs5 east and 53\arcsec north of \tC . Most of \hr\ velocity components have apparent counterparts in \hr . However, 
