  \includegraphics[scale=0.4]{Aim_newnew.png}
  \caption{\textbf{The definitions of CSA and ASA.} \textbf{a} The conditions in classical stable arrangement where the deeper the color, the greater the corresponding return. \textbf{b} The situations in ambiguous stable arrangement where the deeper the color, the greater the corresponding return.}
