Gauss-Manin connection $\nabla^F$ is defined on the chain level by
\[
    \nabla^F:  \mathcal{TS} \otimes \Omega^{\bullet}_{\CC^N}\otimes \O_{S} \otimes \CC ((z)) \to  \Omega^{\bullet}_{\CC^N}\otimes  \O_{S} \otimes\CC ((z))
