\subsection*{1} $f:=x_1^{k+1}+x_2^2+x_3^2$, $G:=\left<g\right>$, $g:=\frac{1}{2}(0,1,1)$, $\overline{f}:=y_1^{k+1}+y_2+y_2y_3^2$.
