The LO matching between four-quark operators in the LEFT and chiral operators is summarized in Table~\ref{tab:operator_matching}. The matching for the LEFT operators in the chiral basis is given by
\begin{align}
    \begin{pmatrix}
        O_1^{(9)} \\
        O_1^{(9)\prime} \\
        O_4^{(9)} \\
    \end{pmatrix}
    &\to 
    \begin{pmatrix}
        1 & 1 & -2\\
