Cluster shape and orientation were analyzed from the same time-lapse videos using ImageJ's built-in \texttt{Measure} function. Each cluster was fitted to an ellipse, and the orientation angle of the major axis was extracted. Breaking events were identified by monitoring the size of individual clusters over time.

