\begin{theorem}[{\bf Minimum Spanning Tree}]
\label{theorem:result}
There is a deterministic algorithm for constructing MST (Minimum Spanning Tree) in the agent-based model that takes $O(m+n\log n)$ rounds and 
\begin{itemize}
    \item $O(\log n \cdot \max\{\Delta,\log n\})$ bits per agent, if dispersed initial configuration,
    \item $O(n \log n)$ bits per agent, if rooted or general initial configuration,
    \end{itemize}
