    \caption{\label{fig:fast_stars} Main sequence stars with projected $2$D speeds larger that $62$ km/s. The initial sample (shown in black circles) is filtered to include only stars with \mbox{$\rm 13.9 < m_{F625W} < 24 \,$} (shown in colored circles, consistent with the observed stellar population in \cite{Haberle2024}, shown as purple stars). The empty circles indicate stars that are remnants of a binary disruption. The shaded gray region shows the $1''$ uncertainty in the cluster center. }
